            "text": "Team, kicking off the Unified Sales and Contact Centre Playbook project. The main goal is to standardize our processes to improve CX and conversion. Let's start by aligning on the pilot's success metrics and confirming the first batch of tasks. I've put some initial thoughts in the Pilot KPIs sheet (A4).",
