            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 379361,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "Four half-days is better. We could also try running shorter, 2-hour sessions and spread them out over a week. That would be even less disruptive. We can cover the core playbook in the first session, scripts in the second, and CRM/process in the third, followed by a Q&A.",
