          {
            "msg_id": "M59",
            "speaker_id": 8337,
            "reply_to": "M58",
            "text": "Great news. Two weeks sounds like a good duration to get meaningful data. I'll make sure Team 3 is prepped.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M60",
            "speaker_id": 379361,
            "reply_to": "M59",
            "text": "Thanks. So we're all aligned on D7: Pilot with Sales Pod B and CC Team 3 for a duration of two weeks. Now, let's define the escalation path for high-value leads (T10). What should be the trigger?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T10"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D7"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M61",
            "speaker_id": 356759,
            "reply_to": "M60",
            "text": "Maybe if the customer mentions a big project or a specific high-end product?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M62",
            "speaker_id": 29962,
            "reply_to": "M61",
            "text": "That's a bit subjective. We should have clearer criteria. From my time as a supervisor, it's better to use something concrete. How about any lead from a company with over 500 employees, or a deal value estimated over $10k?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M63",
            "speaker_id": 379361,
            "reply_to": "M62",
            "text": "That's much better. Let's use those two as our primary criteria. Now, what's the SLA for the handover? Once the contact centre agent flags it, how quickly should a sales account manager follow up?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M64",
            "speaker_id": 269042,
            "reply_to": "M63",
            "text": "The agent should do a warm transfer if possible. If not, they should send an email. The sales person should reply within the same day.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M65",
            "speaker_id": 379361,
            "reply_to": "M64",
            "text": "Let's make that more specific. How about: attempt a warm transfer first. If unavailable, send a high-priority email and the assigned SAM must make contact with the lead within 4 business hours. Does that work?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M66",
            "speaker_id": 29962,
            "reply_to": "M65",
            "text": "4 hours is aggressive but fair for a high-value lead. I'm okay with that.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M67",
            "speaker_id": 8337,
            "reply_to": "M65",
            "text": "Works for the contact centre side. We can track the handoff time in the CRM.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M68",
            "speaker_id": 379361,
            "reply_to": "M67",
            "text": "Great. Let's lock that in. D8: High-value leads (500+ employees or >$10k value) will be escalated via warm transfer or email, with a 4-hour contact SLA for sales. I'll add this to the playbook.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D8"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "👍",
                "count": 2
