            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, our two-week pilot (T8) is complete! The results are very promising. I've updated the Pilot KPIs sheet (A4) with the final numbers. Overall, we saw a 12% increase in conversion rate and a 7% improvement in CSAT. AHT went up slightly as expected, but is within acceptable limits.",
