            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M79",
            "speaker_id": 379361,
            "reply_to": "M78",
            "text": "Good question. We looked into that. It's mainly because we're escalating more high-value leads correctly now, which technically counts as a transfer, not a first-contact resolution. So it's actually a sign the new process is working. Given the big wins in conversion and CSAT, I believe the pilot met our success criteria.",
